<title>PORTUGAL: GEC-Alsthom to appeal Portuguese bid award-source.</title>
<headline>GEC-Alsthom to appeal Portuguese bid award-source.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>An international consortium led by GEC-Alsthom will appeal against a decision not to include it among the finalists in a public competition to build an urban transport system in Oporto, a GEC official source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;GEC Alsthom will challenge the decision of the evaluating commission,&quot; the source told Reuters. The source did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Two international consortia led by Siemens and ABB-Asea Brown were chosen as finalists from four consortia competing to build the transport system.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
